    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No weight loss, fever, or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new bands, spots, or sores</td></tr><tr><td>Hematologic and lymphatic</td><td>Negative</td><td>No lumps in the groin or behind the knee</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Ankle and toe pain-free</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

